MintCurveConvexPosition::add(bytes)
├── given caller is not owner and not authorized spender
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionUnauthorized
└── given caller is owner or authorized spender
│   ├── when collateralAmount is 0 and borrowAssets is 0
│   │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionInvalidInput
│   ├── collateral-only: when collateralAmount is greater than 0 and borrowAssets is 0
│   │   ├── it should pull collateral token of collateralAmount from owner to the position
│   │   ├── it should add collateral to the mint market for itself
│   │   ├── it should improve market collateral for the position without minting DUSD
│   │   ├── it should not borrow from the mint market
│   │   ├── it should not swap DUSD to frxUSD
│   │   ├── it should not add Curve liquidity
│   │   ├── it should not stake LP in Convex
│   │   └── it should emit AddPosition with collateralAmount and zero borrowAssets and lpStaked
│   ├── borrow-only: when collateralAmount is 0 and borrowAssets is greater than 0
│   │   ├── given position has no collateral posted on the mint market
│   │   │   └── it should revert when the mint market rejects the borrow
│   │   ├── given position already has collateral posted on the mint market
│   │   │   ├── when swapTarget is not approved by the factory
│   │   │   │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionInvalidInput
│   │   │   └── when swapTarget is approved by the factory and all legs succeed
    │   │   │       ├── it should not pull new collateral from owner
    │   │   │       ├── it should borrow borrowAssets from the mint market to the position
    │   │   │       ├── it should increase market debt for the position
    │   │   │       ├── it should approve borrowAssets / 2 of DUSD to the swap target
    │   │   │       ├── it should swap borrowAssets / 2 of DUSD to frxUSD through the approved swap target
    │   │   │       ├── it should revoke the swap target allowance after the swap
    │   │   │       ├── it should add remaining DUSD and frxUSD balances to the Curve pool
    │   │   │       ├── it should stake the minted Curve LP in Convex
    │   │   │       ├── it should increase Convex stake owned by the position
    │   │   │       ├── it should emit Swap with DUSD sold, frxUSD bought, borrowAssets / 2 amountIn, swap target, and amountOut
    │   │   │       └── it should emit AddPosition with zero collateralAmount and non-zero borrowAssets and lpStaked
│   │   ├── when borrowAssets is 1
│   │   │   └── it should swap 0 DUSD and still complete the borrow, Curve, and Convex leg with the remaining DUSD balance
│   │   ├── when the swap target call fails
│   │   │   └── it should revert with SwapPositionSwapFailed
│   │   ├── when frxUSD received is less than minFrxUsdOutFromDusdSwap
│   │   │   └── it should revert with SwapPositionMinAmountOutNotMet
│   │   └── when Curve LP minted is less than minLpOutFromCurve
│   │       └── it should revert from the Curve pool add_liquidity call
│   ├── when caller is authorized spender
│   │   └── it should succeed for collateral-only add
│   └── collateral plus borrow: when collateralAmount is greater than 0 and borrowAssets is greater than 0
│       ├── when swapTarget is not approved by the factory
│       │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionInvalidInput
│       ├── when the swap target call fails
│       │   └── it should revert with SwapPositionSwapFailed
│       ├── when frxUSD received is less than minFrxUsdOutFromDusdSwap
│       │   └── it should revert with SwapPositionMinAmountOutNotMet
│       └── when swapTarget is approved by the factory and all legs succeed
│           ├── it should pull collateral from owner and post it to the mint market
│           ├── it should borrow borrowAssets from the mint market to the position
│           ├── it should create market collateral and debt for the position
│           ├── it should approve borrowAssets / 2 of DUSD to the swap target
│           ├── it should swap borrowAssets / 2 of DUSD to frxUSD
│           ├── it should revoke the swap target allowance after the swap
│           ├── it should add remaining DUSD and frxUSD to Curve and stake LP in Convex
│           ├── it should create Curve LP and Convex stake owned by the position
│           ├── it should emit Swap with DUSD sold, frxUSD bought, borrowAssets / 2 amountIn, swap target, and amountOut
│           └── it should emit AddPosition with non-zero collateralAmount, borrowAssets, and lpStaked
